WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.808
Welcome to Module 3 of the
Privileged Access learning path:

2
00:00:03.808 --> 00:00:07.950
Conditional Access for administrators,
and the activation gate.

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:14.125
This module serves the project plan's
task A1.5 in Phase 1, and A2.3,

4
00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:20.300
A2.5 and A2.6 in Phase 2, with
Chapter 03 of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.659
In it you keep the administrator policies,

6
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:26.837
the activation gate and the privileged
authentication strength as files.

7
00:00:26.837 --> 00:00:31.221
You check them before they merge, plan
what a run would change in the tenant,

8
00:00:31.221 --> 00:00:34.312
and see the code create
every new policy report-only.

9
00:00:34.312 --> 00:00:38.532
This is the first module that writes, so
it's the first that could lock people out,

10
00:00:38.532 --> 00:00:42.362
and you'll see the two guards that
stand between the files and the tenant.

11
00:00:42.362 --> 00:00:46.480
The code is illustrative: tested
against fixtures and a fake,

12
00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.010
not run against a production tenant.
